WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.393
Prepare the available native model.

00:00:02.393 --> 00:00:10.243
Chrome generates a typed plan locally.

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.285
Accept plan commits revision one.

00:00:12.285 --> 00:00:19.642
The next turn receives accepted state.

00:00:19.642 --> 00:00:21.700
Accept the revision explicitly.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:25.764
Replay follows captured local output.

00:00:25.764 --> 00:00:29.848
Replay opens no native sessions.

00:00:29.848 --> 00:00:31.000
Back live.
